1
00:01:57,770 --> 00:02:00,630
Now I know who your niece...

2
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:01,920
takes after.

3
00:02:04,080 --> 00:02:07,840
I wonder if the Dechas can handle her.

4
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:10,410
May you be loved and cherished.

5
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:15,240
Still no letter from Thep?

6
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:17,070
One arrived this morning.

7
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:23,150
Why would she want it?

8
00:02:23,890 --> 00:02:25,380
She can't even read or write.

9
00:02:27,930 --> 00:02:30,200
I saw the Lady tear it up.

10
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:36,540
Knowing Thep thinks of us makes me happy.

11
00:02:40,530 --> 00:02:41,150
What's wrong?

12
00:02:41,480 --> 00:02:42,510
How disgraceful!

13
00:02:43,710 --> 00:02:45,450
How can I be sure...

14
00:02:45,910 --> 00:02:47,850
the baby is my grandchild?

15
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:49,610
Indeed, my Lady.

16
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:53,320
My aunt went to Chanthaburi
and sent some fruit.

17
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:56,560
Is this...

18
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:59,800
Bu-nga, how dare you steal
Lady Mok's bracelet?

19
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:00,640
I...

20
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:01,560
Did you find it?

21
00:03:01,930 --> 00:03:02,900
Right here.

22
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:06,520
- But, I...
- It's always you!

23
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,850
First, you tried to kill the Lady.

24
00:03:09,190 --> 00:03:10,860
Now you steal from Lady Mok.

25
00:03:11,090 --> 00:03:12,640
You’re nothing but a born thief.

26
00:03:12,790 --> 00:03:14,430
I really didn't do it.

27
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:17,350
You dare suspect me?

28
00:03:17,830 --> 00:03:20,030
Because you think
I’m a wicked woman.

29
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,770
You do believe that...

30
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:23,190
this baby isn't your grandchild.

31
00:03:23,320 --> 00:03:24,980
You’re just trying to get rid of me.

32
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:26,310
Lock her up.

33
00:03:26,710 --> 00:03:28,280
Don't let her see the light of day.

34
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,890
- She's Thep's wife!
- Shut it, Khem!

35
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:32,030
Otherwise,

36
00:03:32,350 --> 00:03:33,940
you’ll be punished as well.

37
00:03:35,660 --> 00:03:37,650
Get her out of my sight.

38
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:39,720
Go!

39
00:03:41,330 --> 00:03:42,260
She's a human being.

40
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,960
Shall we send her away?

41
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,120
I'm not going back.

42
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:48,160
I'll wait here for Thep here.

43
00:03:56,960 --> 00:04:00,190
I can remember my past lives, right?
If you really can,

44
00:04:01,890 --> 00:04:03,170
you must have seen it all.

45
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:05,570
I feel like someone else is in the house.

46
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,880
Someone... not human.

47
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:10,620
Put these on the front door,

48
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:13,250
the back door, and the bedroom.

49
00:04:13,780 --> 00:04:14,440
Understood.

50
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,010
What's...

51
00:04:17,170 --> 00:04:18,460
that, Dad?

52
00:04:19,170 --> 00:04:20,170
Ploy!

53
00:04:21,180 --> 00:04:23,100
You can never escape me.

54
00:04:23,330 --> 00:04:26,150
You will pay for what you've done.

55
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:38,910
If death were the end,

56
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,770
who would pay me back?

57
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:42,760
Stay out of this!

58
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:55,120
I heard Thep is seeing her.

59
00:04:58,040 --> 00:05:00,230
No wonder he won't come home.

60
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:11,960
Bu-nga! I said wake up!

61
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,400
- Auntie?
- Help!

62
00:05:16,490 --> 00:05:17,150
Help me.

63
00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:18,720
Bu-nga! She...

64
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:19,910
What's wrong with her?

65
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:26,550
She'was heartbroken
that you hadn't returned.

66
00:05:28,610 --> 00:05:30,480
I'm still waiting for Thep.

67
00:05:33,510 --> 00:05:34,490
Hey!

68
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,560
Bu-nga!!

69
00:05:38,480 --> 00:05:40,840
Bu-nga!! No!

70
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:42,450
Help me!

71
00:05:42,580 --> 00:05:43,460
Thep?

72
00:05:43,670 --> 00:05:44,530
Thep?

73
00:05:44,880 --> 00:05:46,010
Did you have a nightmare?

74
00:05:49,010 --> 00:05:49,890
I need to go home.

75
00:05:50,050 --> 00:05:52,370
You need to recover first.

76
00:05:52,650 --> 00:05:53,820
I'm worried about my wife and child.

77
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:32,270
Father.

78
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,690
Where is my baby?

79
00:06:53,690 --> 00:06:55,070
Where is my baby?

80
00:07:44,870 --> 00:07:46,550
The baby was born prematurely.

81
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:48,770
She’s a bit small.

82
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:50,850
But look.

83
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,220
She's a fighter.

84
00:08:22,950 --> 00:08:23,620
Father.

85
00:08:26,970 --> 00:08:29,130
Please take me to Thep.

86
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:33,150
I need to hear it from him...

87
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:36,870
that he no longer loves us.

88
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:39,870
Why would you say that?

89
00:08:41,210 --> 00:08:42,560
Did you hear something?

90
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,320
Did the bleeding start...

91
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,040
because you heard something

92
00:08:52,210 --> 00:08:53,410
upsetting?

93
00:09:02,540 --> 00:09:04,450
I heard people saying...

94
00:09:08,390 --> 00:09:09,110
that Thep...

95
00:09:10,420 --> 00:09:12,100
is seeing another woman.

96
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:17,470
That's why he's not coming home.

97
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,490
I’ll go find him myself.

98
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:50,020
The moment I brought you here,

99
00:09:51,730 --> 00:09:52,900
I decided...

100
00:09:53,180 --> 00:09:54,240
I was going to find him.

101
00:09:55,570 --> 00:09:57,290
Once he knows the baby's been born,

102
00:09:57,910 --> 00:09:59,080
he'll come back.

103
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:45,450
If you suddenly disappear,

104
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:49,050
won't they be suspicious?

105
00:11:49,910 --> 00:11:51,640
You have no relatives to visit.

106
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:57,440
I said I was visiting
a friend in Kantang.

107
00:11:58,520 --> 00:12:00,160
Just be careful.

108
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,140
They have eyes everywhere.

109
00:12:03,390 --> 00:12:05,260
If they find out,

110
00:12:05,490 --> 00:12:06,520
you'll be in trouble.

111
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:02,730
Master Thep!

112
00:13:03,970 --> 00:13:04,680
My Lord!

113
00:13:09,290 --> 00:13:10,110
Where are you going?

114
00:13:11,770 --> 00:13:13,460
I was going to find you in the capital.

115
00:13:15,190 --> 00:13:15,880
Why?

116
00:13:16,340 --> 00:13:17,220
What’s happened at home?

117
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:21,500
Bu-nga

118
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,480
- Bu-nga--
- Be careful, Thep.

119
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:25,480
What's wrong with her?

120
00:13:28,890 --> 00:13:29,710
Khem!

121
00:13:30,890 --> 00:13:31,880
Tell me! What happened?

122
00:13:46,850 --> 00:13:47,570
Thep...

123
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:49,340
insisted on returning

124
00:13:49,970 --> 00:13:51,930
His cast was just removed.

125
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:56,880
Ploy's been nursing him,
so she was worried.

126
00:13:57,030 --> 00:13:59,300
Now that she had to come,

127
00:13:59,570 --> 00:14:01,680
I'd tag along to visit you.

128
00:14:02,660 --> 00:14:05,680
And Ploy can look after
her special patient.

129
00:14:11,410 --> 00:14:12,150
Oh...

130
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:12,950
My dear.

131
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:15,190
You're so beautiful,

132
00:14:15,300 --> 00:14:17,040
and so kind-hearted.

133
00:14:17,800 --> 00:14:18,920
Do you remember?

134
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:20,910
We once...

135
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:21,870
met

136
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,870
at the play

137
00:14:23,970 --> 00:14:25,390
Sao Khruea Fa

138
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:28,850
when the Pridalai Theatre first opened.

139
00:14:29,330 --> 00:14:31,100
You were so small then.

140
00:14:33,900 --> 00:14:34,600
Right?

141
00:14:37,100 --> 00:14:39,470
I remember it vaguely, Auntie.

142
00:14:40,650 --> 00:14:41,790
Auntie?

143
00:14:42,230 --> 00:14:43,390
Just call me Mother.

144
00:14:51,850 --> 00:14:52,470
Oh,

145
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:53,680
Thep.

146
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:59,140
I'll have Uncle Theng get the car ready.

147
00:15:04,670 --> 00:15:05,340
Mother.

148
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:09,200
I know you never cared for Bu-nga.

149
00:15:09,940 --> 00:15:11,860
But your grandchild is hospitalized.

150
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:14,270
Do you even care?

151
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:21,810
She’s fine now, right?

152
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,020
Must I watch over her?

153
00:15:25,600 --> 00:15:26,990
It was life or death.

154
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:28,900
Why no telegram?

155
00:15:29,090 --> 00:15:30,370
If I hadn't returned,

156
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:32,890
I’d never have known.

157
00:15:54,670 --> 00:15:55,710
Thep,

158
00:16:05,040 --> 00:16:06,980
can I visit Bu-nga, too?

159
00:16:08,570 --> 00:16:09,110
Mok,

160
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:11,040
tell me exactly...

161
00:16:11,690 --> 00:16:13,550
what happened?

162
00:16:14,580 --> 00:16:15,980
At the hospital,

163
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:17,270
I'll tell you.

164
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:48,820
I'm taking my wife and child home.

165
00:16:50,800 --> 00:16:51,870
You sure?

166
00:16:52,820 --> 00:16:54,320
Aren't you with another woman?

167
00:16:59,750 --> 00:17:00,930
Did Khem tell you?

168
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:03,810
You know how he is.

169
00:17:04,950 --> 00:17:07,250
He’s loyal to a fault.

170
00:17:09,830 --> 00:17:11,630
The whole station saw you.

171
00:17:12,190 --> 00:17:13,190
Before long,

172
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:15,500
The rumor spread all over.

173
00:17:19,770 --> 00:17:21,650
Just family friends visiting.

174
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:28,010
- Is she being discharged?
- She's coming with me.

175
00:17:29,010 --> 00:17:30,100
She only goes...

176
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:31,490
if the Lady...

177
00:17:31,890 --> 00:17:33,440
comes for her.

178
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:44,520
Please double-check this.

179
00:17:44,690 --> 00:17:45,190
Alright.

180
00:17:59,350 --> 00:18:01,090
Now that I'm settled,

181
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:05,330
I'm taking Bu-nga and my daughter
with me to the capital.

182
00:18:09,600 --> 00:18:10,360
You can't.

183
00:18:11,080 --> 00:18:12,820
I've made an arrangement with Ploy.

184
00:18:13,540 --> 00:18:15,300
I have a family of my own, Mother.

185
00:18:15,660 --> 00:18:17,610
That doesn't matter.

186
00:18:18,260 --> 00:18:20,760
Men often take a second wife.

187
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:24,700
Ploy and I don't love each other.

188
00:18:24,910 --> 00:18:27,640
You clearly care for her.

189
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:29,240
That's not love.

190
00:18:30,510 --> 00:18:32,170
What do you know of life?

191
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:36,500
Status matters more than love.

192
00:18:38,010 --> 00:18:40,590
A wife who brings

193
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:42,930
you no honor...

194
00:18:43,740 --> 00:18:45,180
will only bring regret.

195
00:18:47,930 --> 00:18:49,680
No more arguing.

196
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:51,660
We have spoken. It’s settled.

197
00:18:52,410 --> 00:18:56,190
Obey, or never mention Bu-nga again.

198
00:19:03,740 --> 00:19:04,930
If that’s how it is,

199
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:08,100
then I’ll take them elsewhere.

200
00:19:11,100 --> 00:19:11,860
Thep

201
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,410
Thep!

202
00:19:15,870 --> 00:19:17,740
Wait, Duangkhae.
Calm down...

203
00:19:21,020 --> 00:19:21,870
My...

204
00:19:22,870 --> 00:19:24,790
No one listens to me here.

205
00:19:26,760 --> 00:19:27,360
Thep

206
00:19:29,080 --> 00:19:30,100
Thep!

207
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,450
Thep!

208
00:19:33,340 --> 00:19:34,440
Don't leave.

209
00:19:35,290 --> 00:19:36,660
I’m done obeying you.

210
00:19:37,850 --> 00:19:39,190
You lied to me about everything.

211
00:19:39,830 --> 00:19:41,390
You were never honest with me.

212
00:19:45,850 --> 00:19:47,830
I shouldn't have trusted her.

213
00:19:48,830 --> 00:19:51,110
She loves you dearly.

214
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:53,780
She can't bear to lose you.

215
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:57,570
Please don't tell her...

216
00:19:57,720 --> 00:19:59,510
that I told you everything.

217
00:20:00,580 --> 00:20:03,260
Otherwise, I'll be kicked out, too.

218
00:20:10,380 --> 00:20:12,590
You believe everything Bu-nga says?

219
00:20:13,300 --> 00:20:16,190
Did she tell you
why I made her sleep downstairs?

220
00:20:16,410 --> 00:20:18,110
Why I locked her up?

221
00:20:18,780 --> 00:20:20,490
She stole Mok's bracelet,

222
00:20:20,790 --> 00:20:22,550
and kept talking back to me.

223
00:20:23,130 --> 00:20:25,630
Worse, she fed me eggs!

224
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:29,420
Did you hear me? She tried kill me!

225
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:35,080
Even so, I still let her stay.
I’ve been far too merciful.

226
00:20:35,560 --> 00:20:37,070
You're biased.

227
00:20:37,760 --> 00:20:39,600
You blame her for everything.

228
00:20:40,890 --> 00:20:42,970
And aren't you biased against me?

229
00:20:44,870 --> 00:20:47,370
Love has blinded you
so you think I'm framing her.

230
00:20:48,280 --> 00:20:50,510
She never framed you.

231
00:20:52,640 --> 00:20:53,330
Let's just say...

232
00:20:54,140 --> 00:20:56,740
we'll part ways, as I've decided.

233
00:20:59,320 --> 00:20:59,930
Hey!

234
00:21:00,090 --> 00:21:01,850
- Enough, both of you!
- Thep!

235
00:21:02,200 --> 00:21:03,480
- Wait!
- Let go of me!

236
00:21:03,650 --> 00:21:04,400
Ah!

237
00:21:04,550 --> 00:21:05,420
Ouch!

238
00:21:06,290 --> 00:21:07,080
Mother!

239
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:10,410
- Duangkhae!
- Mother!

240
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,310
- Duangkhae!
- Mother!

241
00:21:11,550 --> 00:21:12,550
Sister!

242
00:21:31,450 --> 00:21:32,750
Careful.

243
00:21:33,580 --> 00:21:34,360
Alright.

244
00:21:41,530 --> 00:21:42,380
You should go to bed.

245
00:21:43,160 --> 00:21:44,670
I'll stay with Duangkhae.

246
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:48,050
But I should care for you tonight.

247
00:21:48,520 --> 00:21:50,820
How can I leave her alone?

248
00:22:03,840 --> 00:22:04,720
Duangkhae,

249
00:22:05,760 --> 00:22:06,650
how are you feeling?

250
00:22:08,910 --> 00:22:09,850
Well...

251
00:22:10,120 --> 00:22:11,760
My wound still hurts.

252
00:22:12,710 --> 00:22:14,680
I’m still a bit dizzy.

253
00:22:17,160 --> 00:22:19,180
It's good we have a nurse here.

254
00:22:19,960 --> 00:22:22,440
We won't need the hospital this late.

255
00:22:25,900 --> 00:22:28,240
I think you should rest.

256
00:22:29,120 --> 00:22:30,930
Don't overthink things for now.

257
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:35,040
If you'll go to the bathroom,
just call for him.

258
00:22:36,470 --> 00:22:36,910
Okay.

259
00:22:38,370 --> 00:22:39,750
I stop overthinking now.

260
00:22:41,310 --> 00:22:44,450
From now on, everyone can do as they wish.

261
00:22:45,080 --> 00:22:46,320
I’m getting old.

262
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:50,230
It doesn't matter what happens to me.

263
00:25:22,720 --> 00:25:24,280
Can’t sleep either?

264
00:25:30,330 --> 00:25:32,820
I didn't think coming here...

265
00:25:33,010 --> 00:25:34,680
would cause so much trouble.

266
00:25:42,390 --> 00:25:43,670
It's not your fault.

267
00:25:44,710 --> 00:25:46,480
Mother never liked my wife anyway.

268
00:25:47,720 --> 00:25:48,620
If it wasn't you,

269
00:25:49,910 --> 00:25:51,670
she'd find someone else.

270
00:25:56,080 --> 00:25:57,880
Is there anything I can do?

271
00:26:15,080 --> 00:26:18,720
Should I take Auntie back sooner?

272
00:26:25,080 --> 00:26:26,580
I have a favor to ask.

273
00:26:40,890 --> 00:26:41,780
Let's get engaged.

274
00:28:03,110 --> 00:28:03,750
Look.

275
00:28:05,280 --> 00:28:06,610
Are you hungry?

276
00:28:28,920 --> 00:28:30,880
Coming here is enough, right?

277
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:33,450
Yes.

278
00:29:24,190 --> 00:29:26,200
It's been two weeks. Time flies.

279
00:29:26,250 --> 00:29:29,200
I know.
But things were so chaotic.

280
00:29:29,690 --> 00:29:32,310
I couldn't take you out anywhere.

281
00:29:32,790 --> 00:29:33,400
Well...

282
00:29:33,560 --> 00:29:36,260
Visit us after the ceremony.

283
00:29:36,760 --> 00:29:37,150
Just...

284
00:29:37,240 --> 00:29:40,300
finish up here so you can come soon.

285
00:29:40,720 --> 00:29:41,140
Listen.

286
00:29:41,340 --> 00:29:43,010
After everything,

287
00:29:43,230 --> 00:29:46,420
I'll take you to a theatre every night.

288
00:29:47,320 --> 00:29:47,780
Okay.

289
00:29:49,220 --> 00:29:51,180
Please take care.

290
00:29:52,110 --> 00:29:53,060
You too.

291
00:29:54,000 --> 00:29:55,680
And don't forget to...

292
00:29:55,760 --> 00:29:57,280
use the money I gave...

293
00:29:57,430 --> 00:29:59,060
for powder and rouge.

294
00:29:59,790 --> 00:30:01,330
Don't let me down.

295
00:30:02,950 --> 00:30:03,480
Listen.

296
00:30:03,880 --> 00:30:05,160
You know?

297
00:30:05,440 --> 00:30:07,460
Songkhla girls are pretty

298
00:30:07,670 --> 00:30:08,970
but you, Duangkhae...

299
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:14,040
are said to be
the most beautiful of them all.

300
00:30:15,480 --> 00:30:17,160
You're exaggerating.

301
00:30:21,120 --> 00:30:21,600
Alright.

302
00:30:22,250 --> 00:30:23,200
Go check your bags.

303
00:30:26,920 --> 00:30:28,730
Take good care of everyone.

304
00:30:29,490 --> 00:30:30,120
I will.

305
00:30:31,070 --> 00:30:33,320
Thank you for understanding.

306
00:30:33,890 --> 00:30:34,800
Trust me...

307
00:30:35,500 --> 00:30:37,700
A man can have many wives.

308
00:30:38,270 --> 00:30:40,970
But a main wife must support your status,

309
00:30:41,470 --> 00:30:43,120
and be worthy of honor.

310
00:30:45,880 --> 00:30:46,750
Yes, Mother.

311
00:30:48,330 --> 00:30:49,080
Careful.

312
00:30:54,360 --> 00:30:55,660
I'll be going now.

313
00:30:55,760 --> 00:30:56,280
Okay.

314
00:30:56,650 --> 00:30:58,020
Goodbye, Auntie.

315
00:30:58,380 --> 00:30:59,540
Safe travels.

316
00:31:00,560 --> 00:31:01,510
I'm leaving now, Mother.

317
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:04,220
Have a safe trip, son.

318
00:31:05,750 --> 00:31:06,190
Let's go.

319
00:31:13,720 --> 00:31:14,610
Goodbye.

320
00:31:27,870 --> 00:31:28,490
Phon!

321
00:31:30,250 --> 00:31:31,460
She went to the market.

322
00:31:31,980 --> 00:31:33,780
What do you need?

323
00:31:34,860 --> 00:31:36,570
Go fetch Bu-nga for me.

324
00:31:50,090 --> 00:31:52,440
So everything went smoothly...

325
00:31:52,690 --> 00:31:54,570
because you faked the engagement?

326
00:31:55,390 --> 00:31:56,160
Yes.

327
00:31:56,640 --> 00:31:58,730
Thep already made a deal with Ploy.

328
00:32:03,450 --> 00:32:04,360
Let's get engaged.

329
00:32:07,380 --> 00:32:08,620
But not married.

330
00:32:10,050 --> 00:32:11,740
I just need time to take my family...

331
00:32:12,820 --> 00:32:14,410
and settle down in the capital.

332
00:32:15,210 --> 00:32:17,320
It'll take about three months.

333
00:32:17,850 --> 00:32:18,970
Then you can call it off.

334
00:32:19,680 --> 00:32:20,590
After that,

335
00:32:21,490 --> 00:32:22,620
all the engagement gifts...

336
00:32:23,110 --> 00:32:24,070
will be yours.

337
00:32:26,260 --> 00:32:28,020
I own a house in Chonburi.

338
00:32:30,120 --> 00:32:31,490
It's not big,

339
00:32:32,560 --> 00:32:34,340
but please take it as a thank-you.

340
00:32:35,580 --> 00:32:37,450
I don't want any of those things.

341
00:32:39,280 --> 00:32:40,430
What do you want?

342
00:32:44,560 --> 00:32:45,370
Just tell me.

343
00:32:46,360 --> 00:32:47,430
If I can,

344
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:49,560
I'll give you everything.

345
00:32:53,800 --> 00:32:55,330
What I want,

346
00:32:55,840 --> 00:32:57,440
you cannot give me.

347
00:33:01,870 --> 00:33:03,550
Let's just say I'll help.

348
00:33:05,130 --> 00:33:07,590
Tell Auntie that we're getting engaged.

349
00:33:09,000 --> 00:33:10,220
I'm happy to help.

350
00:33:14,040 --> 00:33:15,320
Thank you so much.

351
00:33:17,280 --> 00:33:19,400
I will never forget your kindness.

352
00:33:21,180 --> 00:33:22,790
Think carefully, Bu-nga.

353
00:33:23,840 --> 00:33:25,740
No one accepts a broken engagement.

354
00:33:26,120 --> 00:33:28,080
They fear losing their honor.

355
00:33:29,280 --> 00:33:29,920
Then...

356
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:31,370
why would Ploy

357
00:33:31,490 --> 00:33:33,420
agree to help?

358
00:33:35,150 --> 00:33:36,100
My,

359
00:33:36,920 --> 00:33:38,960
you're so naive.

360
00:33:39,960 --> 00:33:42,120
If she refuses to call it off,

361
00:33:42,600 --> 00:33:44,180
no one can stop her.

362
00:33:45,160 --> 00:33:46,630
You know that...

363
00:33:47,140 --> 00:33:49,280
the Lady is on their side.

364
00:33:53,190 --> 00:33:54,680
Are they...

365
00:33:54,810 --> 00:33:56,180
tricking you?

366
00:33:57,890 --> 00:33:58,600
Look.

367
00:33:58,960 --> 00:34:00,560
The night the Lady got hurt,

368
00:34:00,920 --> 00:34:03,960
I saw them together on the lawn.

369
00:34:06,920 --> 00:34:08,270
You must have been mistaken.

370
00:34:09,400 --> 00:34:10,840
Thep wouldn't do that.

371
00:34:16,640 --> 00:34:18,600
He's a gentleman,

372
00:34:20,610 --> 00:34:22,610
if a girl throws herself at him,

373
00:34:22,850 --> 00:34:24,630
he’ll give in eventually.

374
00:34:39,800 --> 00:34:41,920
If I hadn't trusted all of you,

375
00:34:43,680 --> 00:34:45,800
I wouldn't be suffering like this.

376
00:34:50,730 --> 00:34:51,770
What did you just say?

377
00:34:57,820 --> 00:34:58,830
I said,

378
00:34:59,770 --> 00:35:01,640
Chan is a good girl.

379
00:35:02,550 --> 00:35:04,080
Yes, she's very sweet.

380
00:35:04,310 --> 00:35:05,650
Never stubborn or pouty.

381
00:35:05,920 --> 00:35:07,320
If no one plays with her,

382
00:35:07,570 --> 00:35:09,010
she’s happy playing by herself.

383
00:35:09,890 --> 00:35:11,630
But she has a condition,

384
00:35:11,990 --> 00:35:13,530
just like I told you.

385
00:35:14,240 --> 00:35:15,830
You could say she's easy...

386
00:35:16,390 --> 00:35:17,790
or a handful at the same time.

387
00:35:28,940 --> 00:35:29,950
My bad.

388
00:36:00,280 --> 00:36:02,820
How long have you known
this place is off?

389
00:36:06,360 --> 00:36:08,700
Is that why you sold it?

390
00:36:12,200 --> 00:36:13,510
If I knew it was haunted,

391
00:36:14,480 --> 00:36:16,980
would I stay and end up hospitalized?

392
00:36:21,340 --> 00:36:22,160
I agree.

393
00:36:24,090 --> 00:36:25,100
I'm sorry.

394
00:36:29,810 --> 00:36:31,120
I was clueless...

395
00:36:36,600 --> 00:36:38,080
until I found this watch...

396
00:36:40,920 --> 00:36:42,400
and tried to sell it.

397
00:36:46,210 --> 00:36:47,210
The fortune teller said...

398
00:36:47,960 --> 00:36:49,050
everything...

399
00:36:49,760 --> 00:36:50,760
stems from a curse.

400
00:36:53,430 --> 00:36:54,620
But I have no idea

401
00:36:55,080 --> 00:36:56,430
who cursed my family.

402
00:36:58,570 --> 00:36:59,830
What’s that got to do with you?

403
00:37:10,390 --> 00:37:11,400
Peekaboo!

404
00:37:16,760 --> 00:37:17,560
Peekaboo!

405
00:37:19,240 --> 00:37:20,040
Mother!

406
00:37:32,840 --> 00:37:34,830
Is it because I'm still here?

407
00:37:35,500 --> 00:37:37,270
If I leave, will this end?

408
00:37:39,570 --> 00:37:40,920
For you, maybe.

409
00:37:41,800 --> 00:37:42,800
But for me,

410
00:37:43,800 --> 00:37:44,960
it's a curse.

411
00:37:47,330 --> 00:37:49,530
What should we do?

412
00:37:51,920 --> 00:37:52,990
I need to find out...

413
00:37:53,470 --> 00:37:55,000
who cursed my family.

414
00:38:10,100 --> 00:38:12,170
Did Mom bring Uncle Jomthap home?

415
00:38:13,690 --> 00:38:14,500
Yes, dear.

416
00:38:20,410 --> 00:38:21,510
Oh, I forgot to mention...

417
00:38:22,030 --> 00:38:23,460
A friend is staying with me.

418
00:38:23,780 --> 00:38:24,660
His name is Jomthap

419
00:38:25,240 --> 00:38:26,530
Chanchao

420
00:38:26,730 --> 00:38:28,200
really likes him.

421
00:38:46,910 --> 00:38:48,170
I'm not superstitious.

422
00:38:48,340 --> 00:38:49,470
Just a bit spiritual.

423
00:38:53,680 --> 00:38:55,640
Will you let me in?

424
00:38:57,980 --> 00:38:59,970
It would be cruel to keep you outside.

425
00:39:01,880 --> 00:39:04,410
Say that you permit me to enter.

426
00:39:08,340 --> 00:39:10,260
You have permission to enter.

427
00:39:24,120 --> 00:39:25,840
I give you permission, too.

428
00:39:43,930 --> 00:39:46,080
Uncle!

429
00:39:46,500 --> 00:39:47,830
What is it?

430
00:39:47,960 --> 00:39:48,600
Chanchao,

431
00:39:48,640 --> 00:39:49,240
how are you doing?

432
00:41:04,730 --> 00:41:06,420
Busaban wants to earn extra cash.

433
00:41:07,160 --> 00:41:10,120
So I hired her for chores and babysitting.

434
00:41:10,790 --> 00:41:12,930
You'll have more time to work...

435
00:41:13,160 --> 00:41:13,960
and...

436
00:41:14,040 --> 00:41:15,590
focus on whatever you want.

437
00:41:18,790 --> 00:41:20,140
She seems a bit odd to me.

438
00:41:22,220 --> 00:41:24,020
A bit, given her troubled past.

439
00:41:24,740 --> 00:41:26,330
But she's harmless.

440
00:41:27,080 --> 00:41:28,680
Actually, she’s just pitiful.

441
00:41:30,410 --> 00:41:31,390
It's her,

442
00:41:31,690 --> 00:41:33,280
the student I told you about.

443
00:41:34,150 --> 00:41:35,430
The one from a poor family.

444
00:41:36,410 --> 00:41:37,750
She doesn't even have a computer.

445
00:41:40,130 --> 00:41:41,780
I thought it was a guy.

446
00:41:42,150 --> 00:41:42,940
No,

447
00:41:43,230 --> 00:41:43,810
it's her.

448
00:41:55,480 --> 00:41:56,720
Is this room empty?

449
00:41:58,720 --> 00:41:59,840
I'll stay here.

450
00:42:14,120 --> 00:42:15,770
Do you know her too?

451
00:42:21,340 --> 00:42:21,950
No.

452
00:45:38,990 --> 00:45:40,350
Thep isn't that kind of man.

453
00:46:36,880 --> 00:46:37,840
Help!

454
00:46:37,960 --> 00:46:38,800
Help!

455
00:46:39,080 --> 00:46:40,480
Is anyone there? Help!

456
00:46:41,280 --> 00:46:42,240
Help!

457
00:46:45,200 --> 00:46:46,160
Help!

458
00:46:49,040 --> 00:46:51,840
Help! Open up! Help!

459
00:47:41,080 --> 00:47:41,670
Master?

460
00:47:43,690 --> 00:47:45,160
Keep this for emergencies.

461
00:47:46,840 --> 00:47:47,880
I gave some to Bu-nga, too.

462
00:47:48,840 --> 00:47:50,920
I’m afraid Mother might take it.

463
00:47:52,310 --> 00:47:54,370
You’re the only one I can trust.

464
00:47:58,480 --> 00:47:59,610
On this trip to the capital,

465
00:48:00,640 --> 00:48:02,970
I have a bad feeling.

466
00:48:05,920 --> 00:48:07,250
Protect my wife and child.

467
00:48:16,310 --> 00:48:17,160
Can I...

468
00:48:17,610 --> 00:48:18,760
ask a question?

469
00:48:19,730 --> 00:48:21,680
Please be honest.

470
00:48:25,200 --> 00:48:26,100
You and...

471
00:48:26,260 --> 00:48:27,380
Ploy.

472
00:48:27,560 --> 00:48:28,830
She’s like a sister to me.

473
00:48:29,660 --> 00:48:31,160
I don't feel that way about her.

474
00:48:35,100 --> 00:48:35,650
Khem,

475
00:48:38,560 --> 00:48:40,220
I put the address of my home there

476
00:48:40,600 --> 00:48:41,760
and the ministry's...

477
00:48:41,880 --> 00:48:43,030
in the money pouch.

478
00:48:44,360 --> 00:48:45,610
If anything comes up,

479
00:48:45,920 --> 00:48:47,210
telegram me immediately.

480
00:48:47,720 --> 00:48:50,110
I'll also write to my friend, Somkid.

481
00:48:50,890 --> 00:48:51,800
Mother won't suspect a thing.

482
00:50:17,000 --> 00:50:17,560
Ah!

483
00:50:42,880 --> 00:50:43,960
Have you found Ploy?

484
00:50:44,230 --> 00:50:45,260
No sign of her.

485
00:50:45,560 --> 00:50:48,570
Did a student named Busaban
attend the exam this morning?

486
00:50:48,750 --> 00:50:49,690
Our faculty...

487
00:50:49,880 --> 00:50:53,040
has no student by that name.

488
00:50:55,460 --> 00:50:56,900
Is she in our major?

489
00:50:57,080 --> 00:51:00,000
She always sits here.
I've even used this computer.

490
00:51:00,050 --> 00:51:02,280
But that one's been broken
since last term.

491
00:51:02,520 --> 00:51:04,490
Are you sure it's this room?

492
00:51:06,880 --> 00:51:07,440
Ah!

493
00:51:09,240 --> 00:51:11,680
They're tying the knot any day now.

494
00:51:11,760 --> 00:51:13,440
Fool, you’ve been tricked again.

495
00:51:13,760 --> 00:51:15,280
Your marriage is a wreck,

496
00:51:15,880 --> 00:51:17,720
so you hate seeing others happy.

497
00:51:17,820 --> 00:51:18,460
How dare you!

498
00:51:18,710 --> 00:51:19,540
Bu-nga!

499
00:51:19,720 --> 00:51:21,740
Once Thep marries Ploy,

500
00:51:22,010 --> 00:51:23,270
she'll see the truth

501
00:51:23,690 --> 00:51:26,160
and see right from wrong.

502
00:51:26,980 --> 00:51:28,350
Is something wrong?

503
00:51:28,540 --> 00:51:30,510
His Highness is hosting our wedding.

504
00:51:34,760 --> 00:51:35,920
The reason she...

505
00:51:36,070 --> 00:51:38,100
moved you up here...

506
00:51:38,280 --> 00:51:41,160
was to build a house for her favorite.

507
00:51:41,440 --> 00:51:43,070
What's so special about her?

508
00:51:43,160 --> 00:51:45,330
She's not as pretty as you.

509
00:51:45,740 --> 00:51:47,500
Maybe she used black magic

510
00:51:47,770 --> 00:51:49,380
on them both.

511
00:51:50,600 --> 00:51:53,460
We can't just sit back and take this.

512
00:51:56,080 --> 00:51:58,240
You really have to marry another woman...

513
00:51:59,050 --> 00:52:01,280
even though you have a wife and child?

514
00:52:12,880 --> 00:52:16,640
I meant no disrespect!
Please don't hurt me!

515
00:52:16,820 --> 00:52:18,800
You died and forgot everything.

516
00:52:18,840 --> 00:52:21,360
But I'm the only one who remembers.

517
00:52:24,240 --> 00:52:25,520
Look at me.
